近くには、それぞれ石碑があり、儀式に関する事柄を記載されています…ただ、年代が古い物なので、字はかすれて読めないかもしれません。","nextNodeIds":[721430205]},{"nodeId":721430205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":835733690,"text":"この4か所の封印から「御霊真珠」を取り出せば、「心」の封印を解くことができます。","nextNodeIds":[721430214]},{"nodeId":721430214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":3652731250,"text":"そして必要な時に、封印を解いて石枝を取り出し、海祇御霊祭を行います…","nextNodeIds":[721430215]},{"nodeId":721430215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":1881091530,"text":"ですが私が教令院で学んだ知識によれば、聖土化は海祇島の地質構造によって決まっているらしいのです。","nextNodeIds":[721430216]},{"nodeId":721430216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":1746759290,"text":"海水が浸ることで、土が固くなり、元々そこにあった養分が塩分によって排除されます。土にある元素反応が不活性化し、その土は農業に適さなくなります。","nextNodeIds":[721430217]},{"nodeId":721430217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":1345913426,"text":"石枝には大御神の力が込められているため、土に元素を補充することができ、白化の影響を防ぐことができます。","nextNodeIds":[721430218]},{"nodeId":721430218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":2930718098,"text":"コホンッ、すみません、また話が逸れてしまいましたね。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721430206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3637075946,"text":"「五傷岩」の名前について…","nextNodeIds":[721430207]},{"nodeId":721430207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":311175586,"text":"封印がどうしてそのように呼ばれているかについてですか？","nextNodeIds":[721430208]},{"nodeId":721430208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":729855418,"text":"大御神様には神使がいました。神人たちがその亡骸に封印を設置し、その力で海祇と淵下の繋がりを遮断したのです。","nextNodeIds":[721430209]},{"nodeId":721430209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":3043170850,"text":"地図を確認すれば分かります。左にある膨らみが「目」で、右下に伸びているのが「尾」…","nextNodeIds":[721430210]},{"nodeId":721430210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":2226739946,"text":"そ、そのような目で見ないでください…私も同僚から聞かされただけですので！私もおかしいと思ってますよ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721430211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3388110066,"text":"「聖土化」について…","nextNodeIds":[721430212]},{"nodeId":721430212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":794749586,"text":"土の白化は、海祇の地にある「霊」が白夜国に吸い寄せられて沈み、最終的に海祇を砂漠にしてしまうといいます。","nextNodeIds":[721430213]},{"nodeId":721430213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","textMapHash":4261020186,"text":"珊瑚宮の鎮圧作用、そして現人神の巫女様が受け継いだ大御神の神力により、「聖土化」が島全体に拡散することを防いでいるのです。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7214507,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7214604,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7214704,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7214805,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7214301,7214302],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"露子","count":68},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":17},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":13}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFO